,"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.7.2.stable\n\n### System information\n\niOS 26.6.2 (iPhone 12 Pro, Apple A14) - Godot v4.7.2.stable.official - Metal 4.0 - Forward Mobile; exported from macOS 26.6 with Xcode 27.0\n\n### Issue description\n\nOn iOS, every app launch prints this error once, even for an empty project (not tested on Android yet) :\n\n```\nERROR: Mouse is not supported by this display server.\n   at: mouse_get_position (servers/display/display_server.cpp:536)\n```\n\nIt comes from the root Window entering the tree. Window::_notification() (scene/main/window.cpp, NOTIFICATION_ENTER_TREE, root window branch) simulates a mouse-enter event:\n\n```\n// Simulate mouse-enter event when mouse is over the window, since OS event might arrive before setting callbacks.\nif (!mouse_in_window && Rect2(position, size).has_point(DisplayServer::get_singleton()->mouse_get_position())) {\n```\n\nmouse_get_position() is called without checking FEATURE_MOUSE, unlike Viewport::get_mouse_position(), which checks it and falls back to Input.\n\nThe app works fine, but the error is noisy: crash reporting tools that forward engine errors (I use Sentry) record an error event for every launch.\n\n<img width=\"1464\" height=\"958\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ef613ea9-a37e-428f-ae65-3062ecff0e5f\" />\n\nExpected: no error on display servers without mouse support.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Open the attached MRP (empty scene, file logging enabled so the error is visible without a debugger).\n2. Add an iOS export preset with your signing settings and export/run it on an iOS device.\n3. Read user://logs/godot.log from the app's Documents folder (or watch the Xcode console): the error above is printed right after startup.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[mouse_error_mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/32875863/mouse_error_mrp.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124041/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124041/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}